    "bbox_norm": [
      0.473,
      0.054,
      0.524,
      0.536
    ],
    "text": "TOP 8 LAWS OF BIG DATA",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-37:text-1",
    "page_id": 37,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.414
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #1",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-37:text-2",
    "page_id": 37,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.328,
      0.138,
      0.644,
      0.86
    ],
    "text": "The faster you analyze your data, the greater its predictive value. Companies are moving away from batch processing to real-time to gain competitive advantage.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-38:text-1",
    "page_id": 38,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.42
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #2",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-38:text-2",
    "page_id": 38,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.437,
      0.138,
      0.692,
      0.895
    ],
    "text": "Maintain one copy of your data, not dozens.The more you copy and move your data,the less reliable it becomes (example: banking crisis).",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-39:text-1",
    "page_id": 39,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.419
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #3",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-39:text-2",
    "page_id": 39,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.423,
      0.136,
      0.739,
      0.825
    ],
    "text": "Use more diverse data, not just more data. More diverse data leads to greater insights.Combining multiple data sources can lead to the most interesting insights of all.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-40:text-1",
    "page_id": 40,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.484,
      0.138,
      0.675,
      0.891
    ],
    "text": "Data has value far beyond what you originally anticipate. Don't throw it away.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-41:text-1",
    "page_id": 41,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.419
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #5",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-41:text-2",
    "page_id": 41,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.342,
      0.136,
      0.725,
      0.82
    ],
    "text": "Plan for exponential growth.The number of photos,emails,and IMs while large,is limited by the number of people. Networked\"sensor”data from mobile phones,GPS,and other devices is much larger.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-42:text-1",
    "page_id": 42,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.42
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #6",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-42:text-2",
    "page_id": 42,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.328,
      0.136,
      0.645,
      0.868
    ],
    "text": "Solve a real pain point. Don't think of Big Data as a stand-alone new, shiny, technology.Think about your core business problems and how to solve them by analyzing Big Data.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-43:text-1",
    "page_id": 43,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.42
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #7",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-43:text-2",
    "page_id": 43,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.416,
      0.136,
      0.671,
      0.888
    ],
    "text": "Put data and humans together to get the most insight. More data alone isn't sufficient.Look for ways to broaden the use of data across your organization.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-44:text-1",
    "page_id": 44,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.034,
      0.04,
      0.093,
      0.42
    ],
    "text": "BIG DATA LAW #8",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-44:text-2",
    "page_id": 44,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.375,
      0.138,
      0.689,
      0.881
    ],
    "text": "Big Data is transforming business the same way IT did. Those that fail to leverage the numerous internal and external data sources available willbe leapfrogged by newentrants.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
